# Translations: Agatha Christie's The Murder of Roger Ackroyd (1926). English original; a Norwegian
# translation in an edition of its own, read aloud, and in a book with a second novel (A murder is announced,
# also in English); three German translations, the later two under the same title. The two-novel
# book has no collective title and no work for the whole.
# Publication data from the MARC 21 records in swib26/marc/TranslationsAckroyd.xml.

